It's possible to listen to updates in real time from the SDK using the `flagStream` property.

```swift
func subscribeToFlagUpdates() {
    Task {
        for await updatedFlags in flagsmith.flagStream {
            DispatchQueue.main.async {
                flags = updatedFlags
            }
        }
    }
}
